      "narrative": "Beyond Reach Labs, a pre-seed stage space & aerospace company founded by Mitchell Fogelson and Pele Collins, has raised $500K to date alongside $175M+ in letters of intent. The broader Space & Aerospace sector contains 6 public comparables (RKLB, PL, LUNR, ASTS, SATL) and 8 private peers including SpaceX, Rocket Lab, and Planet Labs, though none provide precise valuation anchors at this early stage.\n\nGiven the limited data available, only the stage-progression method is applicable. Using the $500K total raised as a value proxy and applying a 2.5x multiplier typical of Pre-Seed to next-stage transitions yields an implied valuation of $1.25M. Public-comp anchoring via P/S multiples (median 24.6x across the sector) cannot be applied without disclosed revenue. Peer-median triangulation failed due to insufficient same-stage or adjacent-stage comparables meeting minimum sample thresholds.\n\nThe analysis supports a narrow valuation range of $1.06M to $1.44M, centered at $1.25M. This estimate carries material uncertainty: reliance on a single methodology, absence of revenue visibility, and early-stage illiquidity all limit precision. The $175M in LOIs suggests significant downstream capital availability, but such commitments remain contingent and do not affect present-day valuation. Key risks to this range include technical feasibility validation and milestone achievement required to access follow-on funding.",
