      "narrative": "Pulsar Fusion is a Series B-stage space and aerospace company that has raised $15M+ to date. The valuation analysis draws from a comp universe of 5 public tickers (RKLB, PL, LUNR, ASTS, SATL) and 8 private peers including Cowboy Space Corporation, Aalyria, and others at Series B and Series C stages.\n\nTwo triangulation methods apply here. Stage-progression anchors to the $15M total raised as a proxy baseline, applying a 1.9x multiplier typical of Series B advancement, yielding $28M. Peer-median analysis references four same-sector comparables: Sierra Space ($8.0B, Series C), Cowboy Space Corporation ($2.0B, Series B), Aalyria ($1.3B, Series B), and Skyryse ($1.1B, Series C). The median across this set is $1.6B, with a range of $1.1B to $8.0B. Public-comp anchoring was not applied because the target's revenue is not on file, preventing P/S multiple application despite the sector median of 24.6x across public comparables.\n\nThe triangulated valuation range is $24M (low) to $1.9B (high), with a median of $839M. This wide spread reflects the significant stage and maturity variance within the aerospace peer set and the considerable uncertainty inherent in projecting a pre-revenue or early-revenue frontier-tech company. Key uncertainties include technology de-risking progress, capital efficiency relative to peers, and near-term pathway to material revenue generation.",
